Package: zabbix-widget-event-timeline
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, php (>= 2:8.1~)
Description: Event Timeline widget for Zabbix dashboard
 Zabbix dashboard widget that shows how many problem events occurred over
 time as a stacked bar chart by severity. Supports host / host group
 selection, severity filter, automatic time buckets, per-severity event
 details in the tooltip, and theme-aware or custom line/text colors.
